<title>HONG KONG: Hong Kong gold market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Hong Kong gold market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Hong Kong gold market is closed on Monday for a public holiday. Trade will resume on Tuesday.</p>
<p>On Friday, bullion ended firmer at US$387.50/388.00 an ounce, while local gold ended HK$4 higher at HK$3,569 a tael.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6441</p>
</text>
